  unitName: Drakeborn Lodin
  unitId: 40253
  unitNumber: 352
  description: Lizeria, capital of the La Veda Republic, was reportedly once home
    to a mysterious knight. Also known as the "Drakeborn," Lodin wielded his blade
    with reckless abandon in the law-abiding La Veda. As his second name suggested,
    he loved battling dragons as he longed to fight the strongest enemies he could
    find. Though he hated fighting cooperatively, he one day came face to face with
    a powerful foe that he simply couldn't beat on his own.
  summonDesc: Hey Summoner. <br>If you want me to follow you,<br>bring me someone
    to fight!
  fusionDesc: Hmph, borrowing power just<br>like a puny Summoner...<br>I've still
    a long way to go.
